{"productId": "7750ccf5-48df-483b-b6dd-d3fbf93c875b", "modelName": "CZ Tactical Sport-2", "modelDescription": "Known in the sport-shooting world for its crisp single action trigger and long sight radius, the CZ Tactical Sport has now evolved into the TS 2. Mimicking the slide profile of the Shadow 2, reciprocating weight is focused as low as possible. Paired with a redesigned frame and improved ergonomics, muzzle flip is less noticeable than ever. Front and rear cocking serrations make slide manipulation easy and a set of fixed target sights with a fiber optic front are robust enough to withstand the rigors of competition. Aluminum grips, aggressive checkering and a healthy magwell cap it off, and the TS 2 will accept the wide variety of custom parts already available for the Tactical Sport platform.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "3973ebb3-43eb-4da3-9b0f-2d3fd3682d26", "description": "CZ, Tactical Sport 2, Semi Automatic, 9mm, 5.28\" Barrel, Black Finish, Blue Aluminum Grips, Fiber Optic Sights, Manuel Safety, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/96c69ac7-5a74-4494-a87b-4c022fc5fdce", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/cd403b04-403d-4e37-984d-1c06e34d027d", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/1914feef-ada2-4fd0-ab05-441922571d43", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/2be5bb8f-1fe3-400c-9578-c43eb3cf51c6", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/133eb698-e303-43aa-9b41-95f28b959037", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/46f76a31-4433-42b4-94b2-6579f058274c"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "01220", "upc": "806703012209", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "cd129f75-5291-4a2c-b112-feeae8b358f8", "attributeName": "Action Type", "attributeValueId": "55fa8731-23bb-4f00-a865-aae3ddf7b3d2", "valueName": "Single Action"}, {"attributeNameId": "2fa81b83-a1b1-4729-b8